   3.9974764135283613`*^9, 
   3.9974764137875338`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6f0972c0-8375-42e5-b451-\
d3ea1523a9c3"],

Cell["\<\
The 1D-MATH-MODEL test suite systematically validates the exact algebraic \
expressions stored internally for various physical systems, such as free \
space, harmonic oscillators, and time-driven potentials. By utilizing the \
time-derivative constructs verified in the previous suite, it rigorously \
proves that the explicit time-dependent parameters for each specific \
potential model perfectly satisfy the fundamental equations of motion.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.996755428204811*^9, {3.997461231074629*^9, 
   3.9974612356989727`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"18293c14-66df-49dd-8039-\
5349eb3a097a"],

